  59:     Rule:
  60:     - Unwrap the grid border clockwise into a cyclic path.
  61:     - Let n be the length of the foreground segment.
  62:     - Copy the segment with the same color every 2*n border positions around the cycle.
  63: 
  64:     Key insight:
  65:     - The foreground segment is not extended by rows or columns directly; it is a motif on the perimeter cycle, repeated with an equal-sized gap.
